#5303
East Arena Road~
   You stand on the cobblestone path known as Arena Road, which winds
all the way around the battlefield.  A fence of giant steel poles,
welded together in a handsome crisscross pattern, encloses the arena;
you can see the battles clearly through it, but you cannot get in except
through a gate.  Vendors hawk roasted nuts and watered wine to the
passing crowds.  The road continues north and south.
~
53 0 0
D0
~
~
0 0 5306
D2
~
~
0 0 5302
S
#5304
A Dirt Road~
   You walk down a dirt road that leads away from the arena, the roar of
the crowds fading behind you.  Far off to the south the land turns pale
and shimmering, and if that is a desert, it must be the Desert of
Demise, one of the most feared places in all the Dominion.  The road
continues south, and Arena Road lies to the north.
~
