#5309
Southern Gate to The Arena~
   You stand at the Southern Gate of the Arena, a broad archway of iron
and timber through which the battlefield lies to the north.  Here you
can sign up to enter the Arena.  Fighters brush rudely past you, eager
to be inside, and the clamor of the crowd is deafening.  Arena Road runs
east and west.
