#5327
Atop the Arena Wall~
   As you climb the ramp onto the wall, you can clearly see both sides
of the battlefield spread out below.  From here you can even see the
city of Mytherandil off to the east, and far to the west and south
stretches a vast desert.  The wall continues east, and the ramp leads
down to the west.
