#5328
Atop the Arena Wall~
   The view from here is exquisite.  You can see the city of Mytherandil
in all its majesty to the east, its walls and towers gleaming, while far
to the west and south a great desert stretches away.  Below you the
fighters look like toy soldiers.  The wall continues east and west.
~
