#5329
Center of Arena Wall~
   You stand at the highest point of the Arena Wall, on a broad platform
where the archers keep their watch.  You can see the whole battlefield,
as well as much of the land of the Dominion; Mytherandil looks small
from this height, the desert to the south and west stretches as far as
you can see, and to the north something glints like water.  A trapdoor
in the floor leads down, and the wall runs east and west.
