#5332
A Battlefield~
   You are standing on the great field of the Arena.  The grass has been
crushed flat by the boots of the warriors and the claws of the creatures
that have fought here, and the earth beneath it is stained a dark, rusty
red.  The roar of the crowd beats down from the stands on every side.  A
broken spear lies half-buried in the dirt.  The battlefield stretches
north, east and west, and the Southern Gate lies south.
