#5352
Room Inside Arena Wall~
   You descend into a narrow chamber hollowed out of the inside of the
arena wall.  Small holes have been bored through the stone on either
side, just wide enough to peer and shoot through, and a rack of arrows
stands ready against the wall.  The air is close and smells of sweat.  A
trapdoor leads up.
~
