#5353
Below the Bleachers~
   You stand in the shadowy space beneath the bleachers, among the
wooden beams and posts that hold up the stands.  Above you is the first
of three rows of seats where the fans sit to watch the battles in The
Arena.  Spilled ale drips through the gaps in the planks, and every so
often a roar from the crowd shakes loose a shower of dust.  West Arena
Road lies to the east.
