A Split in the Dirt Road~
   The road splits here into two paths.  One runs north and south, and
to the northeast you can see the walls of Mytherandil.  To the south the
path grows very thin as it heads toward a dark line of trees.  The road
to the west most likely leads to the Desert of Demise.
