#5378
A Turn in the Dirt Road~
   At first glance the road seems to end here, but on closer inspection
you see that it fades into a small path that passes through a gateway of
tall trees to the east.  Beyond those trees it looks very, very dark,
though a faint sweet scent drifts out from among them.  The road leads
back north.
