A Dirt Road~
   As you turn down the road leading toward the desert, you see that
even this area is busy.  Wandering merchants and travelers pass by on
their way to Mytherandil, some eyeing you suspiciously while others
simply hurry past, their pack animals laden with goods.  The road runs
east and west.
