Before The Desert of Demise~
   Before you stretches the Desert of Demise, an endless sea of sand
rippling away to the horizon under a merciless sun.  The road you stand
on leads back toward Mytherandil, and remembering where it lies may be
important to your survival.  The temperature seems to climb a few
degrees even as you stand here.  The road leads north, and the border of
the desert lies south.
