#5400
Border of The Desert of Demise~
   Before you stretches the renowned Desert of Demise.  Blowing sand
stings your eyes, but you can still make out the road nearby, the road
that could take you back to civilization, away from this place.  If you
enter the desert, will you ever return?  The road lies east, and the
desert west.
~
