#5401
The Desert of Demise~
   You stand in the great, trackless expanse known only as the Desert of
Demise.  Dunes of blinding white sand roll away on every side under a
merciless sun, and the hot wind hisses across their crests.  A small
distance away there appears to be a path of some sort... possibly even a
road.  But even better!  If your eyes do not deceive you, just around
that dune over there you can see a small pond!  With trees!  Water sure
would be nice right about now...
~
