#5440
The Oasis~
   You made it!  A small pond of clear, cool water lies here, ringed by
date palms and lush green grass, and fruit hangs heavy from the
branches.  Yet there seems to be more to this place than meets the eye.
Small woodland creatures refresh themselves at the water's edge as if
there were no massive desert surrounding them at all.  And how on earth
did they get here?
~
