#5469
Under the Oasis~
   After stripping down to your skivvies and swimming to the bottom of
the pond, you peer around in the clear, cool water.  Strange fruit has
drifted down to settle on the sandy bottom here, and waterweeds sway
gently around you.  Something shiny catches your eye in the distance.
~
