D4
~
~
0 0 5440
S
#5470
The Bookmaker's Booth~
   A low, smoky booth wedged in among the beams beneath the stands, where the
roar of the crowd comes down through the planks like weather.  A long
counter scarred with knife-cuts and ale-rings runs across the back, and
behind it a great slate board is chalked with the names of the day's
fighters and the odds against them.  Nobody brawls in here: the
bookmaker's friends see to that.  The way out is east, beneath the
bleachers.
~
53 cde 0
D1
East, the shadows beneath the bleachers.
~
~
